cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AER-1, please cite it as below."
title: "AER-1: Agent Execution Receipts"
authors:
  - family-names: Zambo
    given-names: Brennan
date-released: 2026-10-22
url: "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-zambo-aer1/26/"
abstract: "AER-1 defines the agent execution receipt: a verifiable record of one AI agent tool call, keeping the exact saved bytes and their SHA-256 digest, proving the saved result was not changed since it was saved."
